  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participatory and Accountable Security Sector Governance (SSG) in Mali 2021-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DCAF&#x2019;s programme &#x201C;Participatory and Accountable Security Sector Governance (SSG) in Mali 2021-2024&#x201D; seeks to contribute to the restoration of conditions favorable to build trust between the population and the security sector.To this end, the programme is supporting local security sector governance structures, as well as internal and external oversight actors, and the security institutions themselves in order to create democratically governed, effective and accountable security institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
